records = Array[String](["FARROW LOG 04\n\nThe specimen does not answer questions. It predicts them. Yesterday it drew our relay glyph before Callum had finished inventing it.", "BRAY PRIVATE MEMO\n\nThe ice-core markings predate Boreas Station by at least fourteen thousand years. Corporate ordered the dating run deleted.", "OBSERVATION 12\n\nEvelyn entered the chamber twice this morning. The second Evelyn knew every name on the manifest, but not which room was hers."])
